==History==
2016
*The Spear Goblins [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level cap to 13 (from 12) {{Balance|Buff}}. The update also fixed the "range bug", which decreased the Spear Goblins' range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but their effective range is unchanged.
2017
*On 16/3/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(16/3/2017)|maintenance break]], increased the Spear Goblins' projectile speed to 500 (from 350) {{Balance|Buff}}. This was done to fix some unexpected behaviour that the Spear Goblins showed.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.3 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], increased the Spear Goblins‘ attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}. A small change to the Spear Goblin's card description was also made {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ damage by 34% {{Balance|Buff}}, but also increased their attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}} and increased their first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Spear Goblins a new 0.1 second deploy stagger from each other {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 30/7/2020, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Spear Goblins' card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins' range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2024
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}. It also added the Spear Goblins to the Goblin class {{Balance|Add}}.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], made it so that Spear Goblins' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the [[Arenas|Arena]] they were placed {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased their range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2026
* On 7/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins' spawn radius{{Balance|Neutral}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins' hit speed to 1.6 seconds (from 1.7 seconds){{Balance|Buff}}.

